        });
    };
}

/** @mainpage BigCommerceDataProvider Module

    @tableofcontents

    @section bigcommercedataproviderintro BigCommerceDataProvider Introduction

    The %BigCommerceDataProvider module provides a data provider API for BigCommerce
    e-commerce services.

    To use this module, use \c "%requires BigCommerceDataProvider" in your code.

    All the public symbols in the module are defined in the BigCommerceDataProvider namespace.

    The main classes are:
    - @ref BigCommerceDataProvider::BigCommerceDataProvider "BigCommerceDataProvider":
      the root data provider for BigCommerce APIs
    - @ref BigCommerceDataProvider::BigCommerceDataProviderFactory "BigCommerceDataProviderFactory":
      the data provider factory for creating BigCommerce data providers

    @section bigcommercedataprovidersupport Supported Features

    This data provider supports:
    - Customer management (create, get, update, delete, search)
    - Customer address management (create, update, delete, search)
    - Product management (create, get, update, delete, search)
    - Blog post management (create, get, update, delete, search)
    - Order management (get, update, search)
    - Shipment management (create, get, update, delete, search)
    - Custom API calls
    - 11 polling-based triggers for carts, customers, orders, products, and shipments

    @section bigcommercedataproviderrelnotes Release Notes

    @subsection bigcommercedataproviderv1_0 BigCommerceDataProvider v1.0
    - the initial version of the %BigCommerceDataProvider module
*/

#! the BigCommerceDataProvider namespace contains all the objects in the BigCommerceDataProvider module
public namespace BigCommerceDataProvider {
}
